{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/58519-favorite-world-of-darkness-esque-movies-and-tv-shows","id":58519,"title":"Favorite World of Darkness-esque movies (and TV shows)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-26T22:08:16-08:00","id":58519,"title":"Favorite World of Darkness-esque movies (and TV shows)","content":"I\u2019m sure it\u2019s been done to death on other forums. But, still, here\u2019s my topic for today. What movies and TV shows make you think of or feel like the WoD? Here\u2019s my quick list. Would love to hear what you all like. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Alien<br /> Aliens<br /> Batman (1989)<br /> Batman Begins<br /> Blade Runner<br /> The Crow<br /> The Dark Knight<br /> Double Indemnity (1944)<br /> Edward Scissorhands<br /> Fargo<br /> Highlander<br /> The Hound of the Baskervilles (1959)<br /> The Howling<br /> The Lost Boys<br /> The Maltese Falcon (1941)<br /> Max Headroom<br /> Rebecca (1940)<br /> Repo Man<br /> RoboCop (1987)<br /> Rosemary\u2019s Baby (1968)<br /> Touch of Evil<br /> The X-Files<br /> The Warriors (1979)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u200b<span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\">Dante \u201cOwns-All-the-Books\u201d Laughing-Coyote<br /> <a href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/91390940/Werewolf%20the%20Apocalypse%20Reference.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf (and Human) Reference Excel Spreadsheet</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/clouddrive/share?s=VoD6R2UDSGwijaft3H4kbM\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img593/9752/w20supporterhiddengarou.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://