alled 'A Magical Place'.</div> </div> </div> </div>You can even see their conventions:<ul><li>May &amp; Ward are NWO operatives.</li> </ul><ul><li>Fitz is from Iteration X</li> </ul><ul><li>Simmons is the Projenitor</li> </ul><ul><li>Coulson is the Void Engineer</li> </ul><ul><li>And Sky is the Virtual Adept that has been turned to the Technocracy</li> </ul><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2518-erasculio","name":"Erasculio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2518_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-07T20:35:58-07:00","id":655906,"title":"","content":"I like The Strain. It isn't exactly WoD style vamps, but I will take a vampire plague over stupid sexy True Blood underwear models any day.<br /> <br /> Also Abraham Setrakian is basically a ghoul, which is kinda fun. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-13T21:58:42-07:00","id":700457,"title":"","content":"A couple newer Vampire movies:<br /> <br /> We Are The Night<br /> A Girl Walks Home Alone At Night","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Demon Cat</b></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://flamingporcupine.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Illuminated Dark Ages character sheets and more</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[]